执行 HTTP 方法到给定的 URI 模板，将给定的请求实体写入请求，并返回响应为 <a href="../../http/ResponseEntity.html" title="class in org.springframework.http"><code>ResponseEntity</code></a>。给定的 <a href="../../core/ParameterizedTypeReference.html" title="class in org.springframework.core"><code>ParameterizedTypeReference</code></a> 用于传递泛型类型信息：
<pre class="code">ParameterizedTypeReference&lt;List&lt;MyBean&gt;&gt; myBean =
    new ParameterizedTypeReference&lt;List&lt;MyBean&gt;&gt;() {};

ResponseEntity&lt;List&lt;MyBean&gt;&gt; response =
    template.exchange("https://example.com",HttpMethod.GET, null, myBean);
</pre>

执行给定的 <a href="../../http/RequestEntity.html" title="class in org.springframework.http"><code>RequestEntity</code></a> 并返回响应，类型为 <a href="../../http/ResponseEntity.html" title="class in org.springframework.http"><code>ResponseEntity</code></a>。给定的 <a href="../../core/ParameterizedTypeReference.html" title="class in org.springframework.core"><code>ParameterizedTypeReference</code></a> 用于传递泛型类型信息：
<pre class="code">MyRequest body = ...
RequestEntity request = RequestEntity
    .post(URI.create("https://example.com/foo"))
    .accept(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)
    .body(body);
ParameterizedTypeReference&lt;List&lt;MyResponse&gt;&gt; myBean =
    new ParameterizedTypeReference&lt;List&lt;MyResponse&gt;&gt;() {};
ResponseEntity&lt;List&lt;MyResponse&gt;&gt; response = template.exchange(request, myBean);
</pre>
